      "seq": 26,
      "kind": "submit",
      "at": 1791589576943,
      "reason": "minbpe/__init__ imports gpt4.py, which imported tiktoken (plus its dependency chain: concurrent.futures/logging, registry, etc.) at module load, even though only GPT4Tokenizer.__init__ uses it. Moving the import inside GPT4Tokenizer.__init__ removes ~58M instructions of startup cost for every BasicTokenizer/RegexTokenizer user. Behaviour is unchanged (GPT4Tokenizer still loads cl100k_base the same way; equivalence harness identical). Measured: encode_ir ratio 0.9146, train_ir ratio 0.9202."
    }
  ],
